    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP action and roguelike multiplayer combat.<strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br>Enjoy three unique modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSI Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you fight using randomly assigned psychic powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transrealm Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you can bring in your own gear and companion characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> \u2013 A roguelike action game that can be played both online and offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> is a roguelike action game set in a mysterious otherworld.  <br>Explore procedurally generated dungeons, encounter a wide variety of items and enemies\u2014some of which can even join you as allies.<br><br><br><strong>\u2605Premium Unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Steam version, the following features are included in the base price and unlocked from the start.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Realm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costume Parts:\u00a0 Cat Set, Dog Set, Rabbit Set, Fox Set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you come to, you find yourself in a small village inhabited by fairies. However, they despise trouble and drive you out of the village. With nowhere to go, you wander aimlessly through a forest bathed in hues of violet. In the dazzling castle that looms far in the distance, what could possibly await you?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758810/extras/d70e80d04331f9cf18545e194f3cf9f4.avif?t=1754573812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP action and roguelike multiplayer combat.<strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br>Enjoy three unique modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSI Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you fight using randomly assigned psychic powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transrealm Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you can bring in your own gear and companion characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> \u2013 A roguelike action game that can be played both online and offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> is a roguelike action game set in a mysterious otherworld.  <br>Explore procedurally generated dungeons, encounter a wide variety of items and enemies\u2014some of which can even join you as allies.<br><br><br><strong>\u2605Premium Unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Steam version, the following features are included in the base price and unlocked from the start.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Realm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costume Parts:\u00a0 Cat Set, Dog Set, Rabbit Set, Fox Set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you come to, you find yourself in a small village inhabited by fairies. However, they despise trouble and drive you out of the village. With nowhere to go, you wander aimlessly through a forest bathed in hues of violet. In the dazzling castle that looms far in the distance, what could possibly await you?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758810/extras/d70e80d04331f9cf18545e194f3cf9f4.avif?t=1754573812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p>",
